    "ownership": "Browser Use is a Y Combinator W25 company founded by Magnus M\u00fcller and Gregor \u017duni\u010d (ETH Zurich). YC lists San Francisco; PyPI credits Zurich and San Francisco. The reviewed edition is the public Cloud API at api.browser-use.com/api/v3, not a mainland-China product.",
    "research": {
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-13",
      "reviewer": "research review",
      "searchCoverage": "Official Browser Use X-Browser-Use-API-Key authentication, GET /api/v3/billing/account, GET /api/v3/sessions, GET /api/v3/sessions/{session_id}, San Francisco/Zurich identity, pay-as-you-go Cloud billing, and dated incident search (Browser Use + security breach/incident) reviewed on 2026-09-13. GET /billing/account is the pinned credential validator and is used as healthcheck. POST /sessions is omitted as a billed write. v4 browsers/profiles/workspaces proxy routing is omitted because native pins a single v3 base URL. Historical OSS CLI litellm supply-chain (March 2026) and CVE-2025-47241 are recorded with the 2026-09-13 waiver; they are not a documented compromise of api.browser-use.com customer API keys.",
